38
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:42,450
Mention abuse controls when the system exposes public APIs or user-generated content. Prepare to zoom into one write

39
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:56,200
and one read at message-level detail. Name the request, validation, authoritative mutation, secondary updates, response, and recovery behavior.

40
00:08:56,250 --> 00:09:09,950
Then answer four predictable pivots: what changes at ten times scale, what happens when the main dependency is

41
